ammar%60%20and%20%60all-grammar%60%20expressions%20retain%20candidate%20CSTs.%0A%20%2A%20Supplying%20both%20%60grammarName%60%20and%20an%20existing%20%60globalConceptSpace%60%20also%0A%20%2A%20stores%20the%20root%20invocation%27s%20qualified%20provenance%20in%20an%20embed%20boundary%3B%0A%20%2A%20other%20parses%20keep%20their%20existing%20root%20shape.%20The%20explicit%20json-string%0A%20%2A%20mapping%20retains%20the%20original%20syntactic%20region%20and%20decodes%20only%20Unicode%0A%20%2A%20scalar%20JSON%20strings%3B%20its%20child%20offsets%20belong%20to%20a%20separate%20source%20plane.%0A%20%2A%20%60options.decorators%60%20%28a%20DecoratorSet%29%20decorates%20the%20grammar%27s%20rules%20at%20the%0A%20%2A%20%60grammar-rule%60%20level%20before%20it%20is%20loaded%20and%20every%20tree%20at%20the%20%60executor%60%0A%20%2A%20and%20%60recovery%60%20levels%20%28see%20%60decorateSyntaxTree%60%29.%0A%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20createGrammarParser%28grammar%2C%20options%20%3D%20%7B%7D%29%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20decorated%20%3D%20grammar%3F.rules%20instanceof%20Map%20%3F%20decorateGrammar%28grammar%2C%20options.decorators%29%20%3A%20grammar%3B%0A%20%20const%20program%20%3D%20loadProgram%28decorated%2C%20options%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20parseTree%20%3D%20%28source%2C%20parseOptions%20%3D%20%7B%7D%29%20%3D%3E%20parseProgram%28program%2C%20source%2C%20%7B%20...options%2C%20...parseOptions%20%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20return%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20parseTree%2C%0A%20%20%20%20parse%28source%2C%20parseOptions%20%3D%20%7B%7D%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20outcome%20%3D%20parseTree%28source%2C%20parseOptions%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20%28%21outcome.ok%29%20throw%20new%20GrammarParseError%28outcome.rejection%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20%28outcome.sourcePlanes%29%20throw%20new%20GrammarRuntimeError%28%27a%20mapped%20grammar%20result%20needs%20parseTree%20to%20retain%20its%20sourcePlanes%27%2C%20%27selection%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20outcome.tree%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20